{
  "_doc": [
    "Abstract interaction scenarios for the sim test apps (test/sim/apps). The same data is meant to be",
    "run by several drivers: apps_reference.mjs (Playwright = reference oracle) and, later, Folk +",
    "emulated USB devices. A driver resolves targets through the app's layout ({testid: {x,y,w,h}}):",
    "the point of {target, at:[fx,fy]} is (x + floor(w*fx), y + floor(h*fy)), default at = [0.5,0.5];",
    "a plain string is a target at its centre. Both ends of a drag are resolved before the button",
    "goes down. Ops: click, dblclick, rightclick, move, mousedown, mouseup (target[, at]);",
    "drag (from, to[, steps]); type (text; US layout, Shift held per shifted character); key (key[,",
    "count]); chord (keys 'CTRL+SHIFT+Z'[, count]); keydown/keyup (key); wheel (target, dy in detents,",
    "+ = scroll down, one wheel event of 100 px per detent); wait (ms); expect (state: subset that",
    "__state() must match now). Key names are hidemu's: CTRL SHIFT ALT ENTER ESC TAB SPACE BACKSPACE",
    "DELETE HOME END LEFT RIGHT UP DOWN, or a single character of the US layout.",
    "'expect' (subset of the final __state(); arrays must match element for element) and 'expectLog'",
    "(patterns that must match, in this order, a subsequence of the POSTed event log) are the oracles.",
    "'dialog' says how to answer alert()/confirm(): accept or dismiss. Wheel events are not counted:",
  "Chromium coalesces queued ones; the scrolled distance (state) is what must match."
  ],
  "scenarios": [
    {
      "name": "events", "app": "events",
      "actions": [
        {"op": "click", "target": "pad"},
        {"op": "type", "text": "Hi 1"},
        {"op": "chord", "keys": "CTRL+SHIFT+Z"},
        {"op": "key", "key": "ENTER"},
        {"op": "rightclick", "target": "pad", "at": [0.25, 0.25]},
        {"op": "dblclick", "target": "pad", "at": [0.75, 0.5]},
        {"op": "expect", "state": {"focus": "pad", "lastMouse": {"type": "dblclick", "x": 476, "y": 236, "button": 0, "buttons": 0}}},
        {"op": "wheel", "target": "pad", "dy": 3},
        {"op": "click", "target": "text"},
        {"op": "type", "text": "ab"}
      ],
      "expect": {
        "counts": {"keydown": 11, "keyup": 11, "mousedown": 5, "mouseup": 5, "click": 4, "dblclick": 1, "contextmenu": 1},
        "keys": ["Shift", "H", "i", " ", "1", "Control", "Shift", "Z", "Enter", "a", "b"],
        "down": [], "wheel": {"dx": 0, "dy": 300}, "text": "ab", "focus": "text", "buttons": 0,
        "lastKey": {"type": "keyup", "key": "b", "code": "KeyB", "mods": 0}
      },
      "expectLog": [
        {"k": "load", "app": "events"},
        {"k": "mousedown", "tid": "pad", "b": 0, "bs": 1},
        {"k": "click", "tid": "pad"},
        {"k": "keydown", "key": "Shift", "code": "ShiftLeft"},
        {"k": "keydown", "key": "H", "code": "KeyH", "m": 1},
        {"k": "keydown", "key": "Z", "code": "KeyZ", "m": 3},
        {"k": "contextmenu", "tid": "pad", "b": 2},
        {"k": "dblclick", "tid": "pad", "n": 2},
        {"k": "wheel", "tid": "pad"},
        {"k": "input", "tid": "text", "it": "insertText", "d": "b"}
      ]
    },
    {
